# PersonaAI UI

Professional presence product — calm, credible, personal. Not a chatbot toy or generic SaaS.

## Surfaces (three modes, one system)

| Mode | Routes | Feel |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Marketing | `/`, `/pricing` | Brand-first, one hero job, one CTA |
| Product | `/onboarding/*`, `/app/*` | Quiet chrome, content-first, clear next step |
| Public | `/u/[username]` | Profile + chat as one composition |

Do not invent screens outside `PersonaAI_Implementation_Plan.md` §5.

## Tokens (use CSS variables from `globals.css`)

- Background: cool ink wash (`--bg`, `--bg-elevated`) — not flat white, not cream `#F4F1EA`
- Text: near-black ink (`--fg`); muted secondary (`--muted`)
- Accent: teal (`--accent`) — never purple/indigo gradients
- Radius: `--radius` (8–12px). Avoid pill clusters and multi-layer shadows
- Fonts: **Fraunces** (brand/display) + **Figtree** (UI/body). No Inter/Roboto/Arial/system default stacks

## Layout rules

- Landing first viewport: brand + one headline + one support line + one CTA group + dominant atmosphere. No stats strips, feature card grids, or badge overlays in the hero
- One job per section; default to no cards unless the card is the interaction container
- Prefer full-bleed atmosphere (gradient/pattern) over decorative abstract blobs as the “main idea”
- App shell: simple top or side nav; primary action obvious (Share / Continue / Publish)

## Components

- Prefer shared primitives under `apps/web/src/components/ui/`
- Forms: label + input + short helper; avoid dense settings walls
- Chat: message list + composer; suggested questions as simple text buttons, not chips-with-glow

## Anti-patterns

- Purple-on-white / purple-to-indigo themes
- Warm cream + terracotta + serif broadsheet
- Dark-mode-by-default, neon glow, emoji decoration
- Dashboard clutter on marketing or public pages
